# === Classic host example (cPanel, O2Switch, VPS, S3...) — DO NOT COMMIT ===
# Usage:
#   cp deploy-examples/static.example .deploy.local   (then fill in the URL below)
#   npm run package                                    (build + ZIP)
# Then: upload the ZIP to the web root and extract it (or send the
# public/ contents via FTP/rsync/s3 sync). IP counter possible ONLY
# via the single backend (HUGO_VISIT_API_URL, see IPS.md).

# Target platform (do not change in this file)
TARGET=static

# Final public URL — REQUIRED (domain or subdomain):
# https://mon-blog.fr  |  https://blog.mon-domaine.fr
SITE_URL=https://example.com

# --- Single visits/IP backend (optional, see IPS.md) ---
# HUGO_VISIT_API_URL=https://mon-licenciement-visits.<account>.workers.dev/api/visit

# --- SEO: verification + IndexNow (optional, see DEPLOY.md SEO section) ---
# HUGO_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
# HUGO_BING_SITE_VERIFICATION=
# INDEXNOW_KEY= (generate via npm run seo:init)

# --- Giscus comments (optional, see COMMENTAIRES.md) ---
# Uncomment and fill in the 4 values copied from https://giscus.app
# GISCUS_REPO=USER/REPO
# GISCUS_REPO_ID=R_xxx
# GISCUS_CATEGORY=Announcements
# GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID=DIC_xxx
